{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)","title":"3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)","slug":"3. mitigations (proteksi binary)","relativePath":"CyberSecurity/PWN/3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)/3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary).md","folder":"CyberSecurity/PWN/3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["roadmap"],"aliases":[],"headings":[],"content":"#roadmap\n\nSebelum mengeksploitasi binary, kamu harus tahu **proteksi apa yang aktif**. Setiap proteksi mengubah strategi exploit:\n\n| Proteksi | Efek | Bypass |\n|---|---|---|\n| [[NX]] | Stack tidak bisa dieksekusi | ROP, ret2libc |\n| [[ASLR dan PIE]] | Alamat acak tiap run | Leak alamat, partial overwrite |\n| [[Stack Canary]] | Crash kalau return address diubah | Leak canary, brute force |\n| [[RELRO]] | GOT bisa dibaca saja | GOT overwrite (kalau partial) |\n\nUrutan Belajar:\n1. [[checksec dan Jenis Proteksi]]\n2. [[NX]]\n3. [[ASLR dan PIE]]\n4. [[Stack Canary]]\n5. [[RELRO]]\n\nCek proteksi setiap challenge dengan `checksec` - itu langkah pertama di [[Alur Mengerjakan Challenge]].\n","excerpt":"#roadmap","readingTime":1,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:0654bc8015aba3d3fea51b4d5ab9267d79d222f6b37dbf9857f5be002ce7607e","outputPath":"CyberSecurity/PWN/3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)/3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)","breadcrumb":["CyberSecurity","PWN","3. Mitigations (Proteksi Binary)"],"links":[{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/nx","title":"NX","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/nx"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/aslr-dan-pie","title":"ASLR dan PIE","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/aslr-dan-pie"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/stack-canary","title":"Stack Canary","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/stack-canary"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/relro","title":"RELRO","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/relro"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/checksec-dan-jenis-proteksi","title":"checksec dan Jenis Proteksi","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/checksec-dan-jenis-proteksi"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/1.-pengenalan-pwn/alur-mengerjakan-challenge","title":"Alur Mengerjakan Challenge","href":"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/1.-pengenalan-pwn/alur-mengerjakan-challenge"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/12.-tools/checksec","title":"checksec"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/6.-format-string/pengenalan-format-string","title":"Pengenalan Format String"},{"id":"cybersecurity/pwn/pwn","title":"PWN"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Sebelum mengeksploitasi binary, kamu harus tahu <strong>proteksi apa yang aktif</strong>. Setiap proteksi mengubah strategi exploit:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Proteksi</th>\n<th>Efek</th>\n<th>Bypass</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/nx\" class=\"wiki-link\">NX</a></td>\n<td>Stack tidak bisa dieksekusi</td>\n<td>ROP, ret2libc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/aslr-dan-pie\" class=\"wiki-link\">ASLR dan PIE</a></td>\n<td>Alamat acak tiap run</td>\n<td>Leak alamat, partial overwrite</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/stack-canary\" class=\"wiki-link\">Stack Canary</a></td>\n<td>Crash kalau return address diubah</td>\n<td>Leak canary, brute force</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/relro\" class=\"wiki-link\">RELRO</a></td>\n<td>GOT bisa dibaca saja</td>\n<td>GOT overwrite (kalau partial)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Urutan Belajar:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/checksec-dan-jenis-proteksi\" class=\"wiki-link\">checksec dan Jenis Proteksi</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/nx\" class=\"wiki-link\">NX</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/aslr-dan-pie\" class=\"wiki-link\">ASLR dan PIE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/stack-canary\" class=\"wiki-link\">Stack Canary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/relro\" class=\"wiki-link\">RELRO</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Cek proteksi setiap challenge dengan <code>checksec</code> - itu langkah pertama di <a href=\"/docs/cybersecurity/pwn/1.-pengenalan-pwn/alur-mengerjakan-challenge\" class=\"wiki-link\">Alur Mengerjakan Challenge</a>.</p>","previous":"cybersecurity/pwn/2.-assembly-dan-memory/register-dan-stack","next":"cybersecurity/pwn/3.-mitigations-(proteksi-binary)/aslr-dan-pie"}